{"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swiduxpersistence\/persistencecoordinator\/rehydrate(into:policy:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence","doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceCoordinator"]]},"metadata":{"conformance":{"constraints":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"State"},{"text":" conforms to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiduxObservable"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"conformancePrefix":[{"text":"Conforms when","type":"text"}],"availabilityPrefix":[{"text":"Available when","type":"text"}]},"title":"rehydrate(into:policy:)","extendedModule":"SwiduxPersistence","roleHeading":"Instance Method","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"SwiduxPersistence"}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rehydrate","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"into","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Store","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux5StoreC"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"State","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Action","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"policy","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MergePolicy","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:17SwiduxPersistence11MergePolicyV"},{"text":"?) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"}],"symbolKind":"method","externalID":"s:17SwiduxPersistence0B11CoordinatorCAA0A00A10ObservableRzrlE9rehydrate4into6policyyAD5StoreCyxq_G_AA11MergePolicyVSgtYaF"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rehydrate","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"into","kind":"externalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"store"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux5StoreC","text":"Store","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/Store"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"text":"State","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Action"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"policy"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:17SwiduxPersistence11MergePolicyV","text":"MergePolicy","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/MergePolicy"},{"kind":"text","text":"? = nil) "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"store","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The live store to reconcile."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"policy","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Narrows the configured policy for this call only. Pass"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/MergePolicy\/preferRemoteAdditive"},{"type":"text","text":" after a container rebuild,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"where a row’s absence says nothing about whether it was deleted."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Takes the store rather than "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"inout State"},{"type":"text","text":" on purpose. Re-hydration is a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"mid-session operation with two "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"await"},{"type":"text","text":"s in it (the flush, then the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"fetches), and any caller holding a state snapshot across those would"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"overwrite everything dispatched in between. Here the flush and every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"fetch complete first; only then does one suspension-free step pack a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"fresh snapshot, merge, and unpack."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Under the default "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/MergePolicy\/preferRemote"},{"type":"text","text":", remote edits and remote"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"deletions surface mid-session. An ID is exempt whenever the local side"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"still has something to say about it — a drained-but-unflushed write, an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"un-drained edit, a pending deletion, or a write whose save failed. Those"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"always win, and that guarantee is not configurable."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Pending writes and deletions are flushed to disk ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"before"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" the merge, so a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"remote-change refresh that fires during the debounce window can’t read a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stale disk row for an entity the user just edited or deleted and resurrect","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it. The flush closes most of the window; the dirty set closes what the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"remaining suspension points let through.","type":"text"}]},{"style":"important","name":"Important","type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"One case can’t be inferred — an edit still sitting in a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"view’s local "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@State"},{"type":"text","text":" has never reached the store, so a remote value"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can land underneath it. Bindings made with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"store.binding(_:sending:)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"dispatch on write and are covered already. Otherwise declare the edit"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceCoordinator\/editing"},{"type":"text","text":" (see "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/EditingHolds"},{"type":"text","text":"), which exempts one ID for as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"long as it is being edited, or register a whole collection with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/MergePolicy\/preferInMemory"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If a fetch fails, the corresponding "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EntityStore"},{"type":"text","text":" is left untouched"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and the failure is reported via "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onFailure"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Re-hydration that reconciles stored rows into the live ","type":"text"},{"code":"EntityStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"without dropping unflushed writes or in-progress edits (rule #8).","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceCoordinator\/rehydrate(into:policy:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://SwiduxPersistence/documentation/SwiduxPersistence/MergePolicy/preferRemoteAdditive":{"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpersistence\/mergepolicy\/preferremoteadditive","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"preferRemoteAdditive","abstract":[{"text":"Remote edits surface, but absence from the snapshot never removes a live","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"entity.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/MergePolicy\/preferRemoteAdditive","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"preferRemoteAdditive","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MergePolicy","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:17SwiduxPersistence11MergePolicyV"}]},"doc://SwiduxPersistence/documentation/SwiduxPersistence/PersistenceCoordinator":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"PersistenceCoordinator"}],"title":"PersistenceCoordinator","type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Owns the ","type":"text"},{"code":"ModelContainer","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" + generic "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/EntityDB"},{"type":"text","text":" and wires the registered"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entities into a "},{"code":"Swidux.PersistencePlugin","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"PersistenceCoordinator"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpersistence\/persistencecoordinator","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceCoordinator"},"doc://SwiduxPersistence/documentation/SwiduxPersistence/PersistenceCoordinator/editing":{"url":"\/documen